Modifications to Euro-Office / ONLYOFFICE components
--------------------------------------------------

go-office is a Go library and HTTP server that integrates with Euro-Office /
ONLYOFFICE browser clients. The editor UI (`web-apps/`, `sdkjs/`) and converter
binaries (`x2t`) are **not** vendored or modified in this repository. They are
downloaded at build time from the pinned Euro-Office Document Server release
(see `scripts/euro-office.version` and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES`).

Changes made by this project are limited to the Go code in this repository
(document server, coauthoring protocol adapter, asset fetch tooling, demo UI,
and Docker packaging). See `CHANGELOG.md` for release history.

