Branding (AGPL Section 7)
-------------------------

The ONLYOFFICE / Euro-Office editor UI includes branding and attribution that
must remain visible under AGPL Section 7 ("Additional Terms"). When you deploy
go-office you must **not** remove, obscure, or replace ONLYOFFICE / Euro-Office
logos, "Powered by" notices, or other required attribution in the editor
interface unless you have a separate written permission from the rights holder.

go-office does not currently enforce branding in code; compliance is the
responsibility of deployers and integrators. Future versions may add checks or
documentation to make this obligation clearer.
